- @title = "Data Request Started"

- render "themes/theme"

.page-box.last-box.page-box-no-padding.text-center
  .header-container
    .container
      %h1.page-heading.text-center
        Looking to
        = icon("fas", "cloud-download-alt")
        download data?
  .container
    .page-box-padding
      .lead
        Fill out a data request in
        = succeed "." do
          %strong a few short steps
        %br
        Save
        %strong drafts
        and
        %strong submit
        when ready!

      .mt-5.mb-0.p-3.bg-warning.text-left.rounded
        .d-flex.flex-row.align-items-center
          .p-3= icon "fas", "exclamation-triangle", class: "icon-child-md"
          %div
            %p
              %strong
                NOTICE:
            The US DOJ implemented new regulations that prohibit access to US data by Countries of Concern and Covered Persons as defined by
            = surround "", "." do
              = link_to "28 CFR Part 202", "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-28/chapter-I/part-202"
            Countries of Concern are People’s Republic of China (including Hong Kong and Macau), Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, and Venezuela.  In accordance with these regulations, we are required to deny your access to the data contained in the National Sleep Research Resource if you are located in a Country of Concern or are otherwise a Covered Person under the regulations.  If you have any questions, please contact
            = surround "", "." do
              = mail_to "support@sleepdata.org", "support@sleepdata.org"


      - if @dataset.request_warning.present?
        .mt-5.mb-0.p-3.bg-warning.text-left.rounded
          .d-flex.flex-row.align-items-center
            .p-3= icon "fas", "exclamation-triangle", class: "icon-child-md"
            %div
              %p
                %strong
                  = @dataset.name
                  = surround "(", ")" do
                    = @dataset.slug.upcase
              = simple_markdown(@dataset.request_warning)

      .my-5
        = link_to data_requests_start_path(@dataset), method: :post, class: "btn btn-lg btn-primary btn-shadow" do
          Click to start
          = icon("fas", "caret-right")

      .lead
        After submission, please allow up to three (3) weeks for your request to be reviewed by the NSRR team.
        %br
        Questions? Send us an email at
        = succeed "." do
          = mail_to ENV["support_email"]
